# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend environment template — copy to `.env`, never commit `.env`.
#   cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env
#
# Same-origin API path. In dev, Vite proxies `/api/*` to the Express
# backend at http://localhost:5001 (see vite.config.ts) because the
# backend has no CORS enabled. Production must serve frontend + backend
# from one origin, or the backend team must enable CORS — then point
# this at the absolute backend URL instead.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
